     <text:p text:style-name="P106"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#__RefHeading___Toc1332_2265125796" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">7.1. Estat de l’art<text:tab/>6</text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="P106"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#__RefHeading___Toc1334_2265125796" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">7.2. Disseny de les classes principals<text:tab/>6</text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="P106"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#__RefHeading___Toc1336_2265125796" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">7.3. Disseny de la interfície del sudoku<text:tab/>6</text:a></text:p>
